    "summary": "Costs 1 CP. When an enemy chooses shooting targets in its Shooting phase, pick a targeted CHARACTER unit with the AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM keyword. Omit OFFICIO ASSASSINORUM candidates. The model’s invulnerable save becomes 4+ for the remaining phase. Once that shooter has resolved its attacks, the model may make a Normal move capped at 6 inches using FLY. It cannot make this move while within enemy Engagement Range.",
